            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Ownership graphs now show same-parent siblings alongside the selected chat and each visible ancestor level, including hidden and offline sessions across hosts. Only the selected chat's descendant subtree expands. On macOS, opening the graph or changing focus centers the selected card, while fleet refreshes preserve manual panning. Hidden-session navigation remains transient and window-local.
]]></description>
